          <string>&lt;h3&gt;A separate workspace for every game setup&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An instance keeps one game's profiles, mods, downloads and settings together. Choose Global or Portable to store a separate data set managed by this MO2 installation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Choose Isolated to copy the MO2 application into its own folder for one game. Elden Ring is the first supported game for isolated copies.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
